From 8bd11623a5eecf8388b0ab3b275b7146f4facce2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JeyKul <minkajey@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 15:34:22 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] gts7xlwifi: add touchscreen and pogo trackpad support

Touch uses the FTS driver from r8q-arch on a per-bus FIFO path. The
trackpad currently crashes the pogo MCU on first touch; frame logging is
kept in to debug that.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
